/// capable of failing is worse than no test): `testStampDetectionCatchesAGenuineOrphan_designProof`
/// backgrounds a marked, `disown`ed stamper instead of quitting cleanly, so it keeps touching its
/// file regardless of whether the app's teardown is healthy. That proof doesn't depend on the engine
/// at all (a disowned process outlives its parent shell exiting, healthy teardown or not), so it is
